---
config:
  layout: elk
---

flowchart TD
    ObjectiveSystem[ObjectiveSystem.onEnter] --> Hud[Create HUD layer]
    Hud --> Update[ObjectiveSystem.update]
    Update --> Manager["ObjectiveManager.update(world, bus)"]
    Manager --> Obj[Objective.update]
    Obj --> Rules{All rules met?}
    Rules -->|yes| Complete[Mark objective completed]
    Rules -->|no| Pending[Remain incomplete]

    Obj --> RuleSet[ObjectiveRule set]
    RuleSet --> HasItem[HasItemRule]
    RuleSet --> Reach[ReachLocationRule]
    RuleSet --> And[AndRule]
    RuleSet --> Or[OrRule]

    Manager --> AllDone{All objectives complete?}
    AllDone -->|yes| LevelComplete[Publish LevelCompletedEvent]
    AllDone -->|no| Continue[Keep updating HUD]
    LevelComplete --> GameEndSystem[GameEndSystem]
    GameEndSystem --> MainMenu[Pop scene, push MainMenu, switch menu state]
    Update --> HUDText[Render objective text and rule status]
